--[[
	Chess Duels - Robscript Team
	Version 1.0 | Auto play and best move arrows

	How it works: the game ships a complete chess engine in
	ReplicatedStorage.Chess (Engine holds the position and the move
	generator, Bot runs the negamax search) and sends the live position to
	the client as an Engine-serialised table on the ChessRemotes.Update
	remote. This script deserialises that same snapshot, runs the game's own
	search on a clone of it, and then either paints the result over the board
	or plays it through ChessRemotes.Action with the exact payload the game's
	own board view sends: "move", { from, to, promo }.

	The server stays the only authority. Nothing here writes game state, no
	move is invented: every move comes out of the game's own legal move
	generator and is re-checked against fresh legal moves right before it is
	sent.
]]

